- Summary: Fixed the new `comm_link` crash path triggered by Connection Info reset and scan actions.\par
- Notes: `main/CommunicationFunctions.c` now increases the communication-task stack size, allocates AP-record scan buffers on the heap instead of the task stack, and keeps the Wi-Fi hardware precheck path in place. Verified with successful build, flash to `COM9`, and 20-second post-flash log review showing the previous stack-overflow fault is gone.\par
\par
